{"text": "At the end of the tunnel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boat rushed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into a big canal. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The paper got softer and softer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the boat began to sink. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As he sank. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He thought of the dancer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And then a fish swallowed him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later the fish was caught. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a cook cut it open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She found the soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And carried him back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the same room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was the dancer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Still standing on one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, for no reason. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A little boy threw him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into the stove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He felt himself melting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he still stood firm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his gun. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly a door opened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the wind blew the dancer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into the stove too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The maid found a little tin heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the ashes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of the dancer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only her spangle was left. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And it was burned black.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "n", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "u", "n", "n", "e", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "a", "t", " ", "r", "u", "s", "h", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "c", "a", "n", "a", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m